                    hint_fit:               `Cultural-Fit has dropped below the floor — you're imposing empowerment rather than adapting it. Reframe through paternalist care and bring the veteran supervisor in as an owner.`,
                    hint_voice:             `You've signalled that speaking up is unsafe. Reinforce delegated authority and drop the mandate — empowerment dies the moment voice gets punished.`,
                    hint_engage:            `Engagement is dangerously low — the floor doesn't believe the change is for them. Invest in recognition and protected time, and frame it as the firm's care.`,
